                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>We are aware that there are several websites and companies offering cheap knockoff knives or unrealistic prices for similar products. We have received numerous reports of customers receiving fake tracking numbers or no delivery at all from such sources.</p><p><br/>We would like to caution our customers against purchasing from these websites as we cannot guarantee the quality, safety, or trustworthiness of these products. Our legal team is actively addressing this issue to protect our customers from fraud and subpar products. We take full responsibility for our products, which are made by our skilled artisans. We do not have any external retailers or resellers, and any product purchased from an unauthorized source will not be covered by our warranty.</p>",
